#: io.github.asdfjkl.xfburn-x.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid ""
"Xfburn-X is an enhanced fork of Xfburn based on the libburnia libraries, "
"designed to install side-by-side with upstream Xfburn without conflicts. It "
"can blank rewritable discs, burn and create ISO images, create audio CDs, "
"and burn data compositions to CD, DVD, or Blu-ray (including M-DISC), with "
"built-in post-burn per-sector hash verification and a user-mode diagnostic "
"flight-recorder logger."
msgstr "Xfburn-X es un fork melhorat d’Xfburn basat sus las bibliotècas libburnia, concebut per s’installar a costat d’Xfburn original sens conflictes. Pòt escafar de discs reescrivables, gravar e crear d’imatges ISO, crear de CD àudio e gravar de composicions de donadas sus CD, DVD o Blu-ray (M-DISC inclús), amb una verificacion integrada del hachatge per sector aprèp gravadura e un jornalizaire de diagnostic en mòde utilizaire."

